      "content": "6.1 Importance of Animal Husbandry"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Understanding the overall Importance of Animal Husbandry is central to agricultural management.",
        "Knowledge of Important Indian Cattle Breeds is crucial for livestock classification.",
        "Dairy Science covers fundamental concepts related to milk production and processing.",
        "Poultry Science and Fisheries constitute primary allied sectors within livestock studies."
      ],
