            "<p>Layer Breeds</p>",
            "<p>BV-300, Lohmann Brown, Hy-Line; 300+ eggs/year; eggs at 18 weeks</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Indigenous Breeds</p>",
            "<p>Aseel, Kadaknath (Jhabua, MP), Chittagong, Busra; low egg yield but quality meat</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Kadaknath</p>",
            "<p>Black meat due to melanin; medicinal value; GI tag for Jhabua, MP</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Housing Systems</p>",
            "<p>Deep litter system; Cage system (Battery cage); Semi-intensive; Backyard</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Brooding</p>",
            "<p>Care of chicks in first 4 weeks; temperature 35°C at week 1, reducing by 3°C/week</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>FCR (Feed Conversion Ratio)</p>",
            "<p>Feed consumed / Body weight gained; lower is better; broiler FCR target &lt;1.8</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Diseases</p>",
            "<p>Newcastle Disease (Ranikhet), Marek's Disease, Gumboro (IBD), Avian Influenza (H5N1)</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Newcastle Disease</p>",
            "<p>Viral; torticollis, nervous signs; highly contagious; vaccination with Lasota vaccine</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Avian Influenza</p>",
            "<p>H5N1 strain; zoonotic risk; affected birds culled; notifiable disease</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
